# CURATED-SA-GEODATA-IMPORT-1 — large GeoNames source dumps
# (re-download anytime via Stage 1: node scripts/geodata/import_sa_geonames.mjs)
db/places/sources/*.zip
db/places/sources/*.txt

# CURATED-GEODATA-EUROPE-1A — large intermediate candidate JSONs that
# exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit (FR/GB only). These are regeneratable
# from the GeoNames source dumps via Stages 1-3. The persistent audit
# trail lives in `reports/{cc}-geodata-*.md` and the consolidated
# `db/places/candidates/europe-1a-arabic-quality.json` (high-tier summary,
# kept small).
db/places/candidates/fr-geonames-raw.json
db/places/candidates/fr-geonames-normalized.json
db/places/candidates/fr-geonames-candidates.json
db/places/candidates/gb-geonames-raw.json
db/places/candidates/gb-geonames-normalized.json
db/places/candidates/gb-geonames-candidates.json

